      "end_line": 7,
      "raw": "LVRS-Svelte is distributed under MIT; see LICENSE.\nThe LVRS theme, component visual contracts, motion parameters and SVG assets are adapted from\nhttps://github.com/iisacc-Justmoong/LVRS, snapshot 953189f1217b8eab6ec0abba23c8ad5dc6a43ef2 (2026-09-13).\nThe package includes the general-control and card SVG subset from that repository.\nPretendard is a preferred font family, not an embedded font dependency; applications supply their own font files.\n"
